    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing, i don't even want \"stability\" or \"small ways to find meaning.\" those feel like distractions. if the entire foundation of who i was is gone, it feels like the person who was supposed to be living this life is already dead. i'm just a ghost inhabiting a body that doesn't have a purpose anymore. it feels more like a mistake to keep pretending there's something to rebuild.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
